-- Add reference_loot_template rows present in the upstream LegionCore 2024-10-23 world dump
-- (The-Legion-Preservation-Project/LegionCore-7.3.5) but missing from our world DB.
-- Source used the pre-refactor combined encoding (negative mincountOrRef = reference,
-- negative ChanceOrQuestChance = quest-required); converted to our split Reference/
-- QuestRequired columns per LootMgr.cpp loading query (Entry, Item, Reference, Chance,
-- QuestRequired, LootMode, GroupId, MinCount, MaxCount). No source row had a negative
-- mincountOrRef, so Reference is 0 for all of these (plain item drops, not nested refs).
-- 11 source rows with Entry > mediumint unsigned max (16777215) were skipped: too large
-- for this column and not referenced by anything that could point to them.
